    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d87b3a6ffed2e6c65c8b99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP 已经满了呢。\\n为了船桥的未来，让我们一起不断锻炼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec123a85ba16ca6416f3f2c0284096463512c90744ce8de19f3bf1d536cb4a86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e4c498bdfce7f147ffb023e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训酱，给你个好消息～。\\nTP满了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bf7d92f91a5545e58473d683a913956991459749a6982d5f165c0113d65b739",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203818568a4a7a98efb9b8bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂，TP攒满了！\\n我会拼命锻练，让所有人都刮目相看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67984ec1dcdfece78bdc85e217fe7cef1df180ffaaf30f9e3d7e6b25c22853f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317ba951457a851720a268cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经攒满了。\\n让我们华丽地开跑吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5f2718ce4a83672712d530624ffd10d34b7ff7c71a102d0410fc294ce86db6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da18dc6b9e898a6299688fbd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "报告。TP已全恢复。\\n训练准备也已完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "009265db90abae60d295d197293bb08a8ac160deb8b7f15fc0230c710a582c13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9adbd9af1ce4748897bdbd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……TP已充盈。若想开始锻炼，\\n随时奉陪。我会为你准备好欢迎的一杯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "485cd01bd15d70d11d1bf580cd3355a18ebb6b4c268af0f5c6c9e59788ae7467",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88999b65572a9d132ce167f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已达上限。这边的准备已经完成，\\n请开始训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1149a8fd95a90c7136e2ce5b791600ba327ecd5646ae428b1a2f6850923db3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ded3e572b57e9a8233400a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP已经满了。\\n该做什么，你应该很清楚吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "848a7ffd4ff816bffd7ba8002eeffe3d55c5fdaab5ffbe92c06902a79ac648e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c88178b00c6fad85884aa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "＜热搜词：TP全恢复！＞\\n所以可以开始训练了。请多关照。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a84a6c323025ccd946b9e7283a694d0c81a7b7e691869b1bf7a3a884d1d67da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46420f6b7d60bf36c38c9d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满啦！\\n那么，该从哪一项开始练起呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ff1f86452e5f0549c5607bfd7e0f89210bcab04d5586bc84823d1f2313b11f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa45c096c6a8d0040f1bb22d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像已经攒满了。\\n可以的话，那个……要训练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea5b1cbf188dd222eb45c31b340ad1a52f1c9404f5fe62b7bdfc150578506533",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1f4602edf35a71313d5856",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看起来 TP 已经积攒起来了。\\n为了成为妹妹们的榜样，今天也要加油才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d768ec08aac6d189731e4f5d579f80948ddb2288ed90dc7186c5bd3171b8da2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fc2c7595e14b905547b6de3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP满了哦！\\n我会乖乖等着你的，快点来呀♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "658e36995de6019d1b6a2572958b5b33be6c1e956a5ab30250f471c164b1feb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a358dc0095c25dd81f33701d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，TP攒满了呢。\\n我随时都在等着你哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "850c2c22187cf8de1749b693f7b1ed7a803090865aa9031eabe5b3a1b91b0d52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a311369075478181d9aff8ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像已经恢复了。\\n今天也想跑个痛快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c89c85b9ce6b43dd26d55df862e1bae48226f511f03c36275170e69858d935",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c821e5283d3d80687b62edd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好嘞，TP攒满了。\\n喂，训练要开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c49ec217fffbc84842d63b10255a9dc2fda813deab240ceeb7071610dd2763c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea94ee18341b120f25a5e09e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP恢复了。\\n那么……我先去准备了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7199b18502345cf3345e4681a1fc64534c3a9938cca55903f2d1563779007de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e7cfb06a75a06ce85677ec3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，TP 积攒够了。时机已到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d522f171af9f14f884a1bc00223c1a7789ab907950c0a8f61490cdc91900b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb6d59c08e12ba27f4bf6671",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满了。又可以见到你了呢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7948459c38afc6de041e5836fdb8aba1e7bed94b8fdf5ad1eaf8e00edc7b8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4724ffa1231fae3243b5528e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP全恢复！阳气也十分充沛，\\n随时可以开始训练哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3181166a0a6d2861a3f62c6c88d5fc820fb234b8b55b8dcf9cb380e5d3f360c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2b670f83245b714e91b27f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经恢复了。我会先做热身，\\n请随时过来指导！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28b1674efd57bdf6abfea62dc4a806f86a21ffa5cd49c755a36dc851196d0bcd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b699f1027cef1d80eb5012e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满啦。日积月累，\\n努力训练。今天也请多关照喽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4422ade5aeec0de21688fbd67b36fdd8c7f928c48988bb4a035bead403825b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90dfb93ef8a8e618fc261629",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "瞧，TP已经满了！\\n拨动轻快的足音，为协奏曲做准备吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dc6444b4a05a9fae658d6d4de4e2316ee5c5e18698c7901c1f14ce9992d211e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c25fa03ca5e6e46473c147ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满喽～☆呼呼咻！\\n——怎么样，这个角色设定如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c6814d4605878ffb72e42ad0eee9eeee4bca081e0638c2d37d78ec227143b01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fb66091c0704554afe5e1d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂——TP满啦！\\n训练员，拜托给我热火朝天地练起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd3ac798cd3b487e91e08cadfd3ea73b254ebf3cfa253e55afbf59dec802295c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5af6569676de846d2643577",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，『TP』已充盈。\\n新宇宙处于信号“待机”状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e71ecb7d00a5981b5c4c0eb2cfe4a652b7b8d03efd90829b36f5750e4469c774",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6834c10f0bf6cb150c700577",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，TP好像恢复了呢～。\\n训练……要开始吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04e47ab2dd13d88691f457a96c9a26e18b05c329cb49a4f43cdb00b87b515fb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b14208d22159db286c6c0ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满了啊。\\n来吧，开始训练。为了梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d189ca2cced7327598854cfc8312c0fc93160f02d14ed067d562e4ec2ea9bb1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe4a654b38e1f86904aead47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP满了。\\n立刻开始吧，为了能一直身为“最强”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f62bcd8fe3952bed0496fdfbddcbe5eb1fac35a1023ab4fa786eb0e65a89c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:185f4482ff6b676e4ba146b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满了！\\n为了三冠王，加油！哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7341ddfbfc857d27902a25592e363209d995133428bd5220d39a3d9dc1db5845",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aac1d0a84a00f48bf2b5864",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP攒满啦！\\n我会准备好等你的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c2b2d5a143ca6f17d0f72072a7373a3fc4b508695cddb0f257af7b75ff2e4e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a4af420b8b801167cf2b59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP 已恢复，特此通知。\\n此处的准备工作也已就绪，随时可以开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9037714379c866101758046f5fe887894dfa3a29a36c0e35bde55b58982044ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc807ba18ed76040ff31ba11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hey, FYI——TP已经回满了！\n训练计划就交给你了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37a6ad581770ddb00073d1b1fb0cb2ad3db0f086963d76223347afa580eb0cad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3463a533ffbc1a29dee75955",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀！TP这就MAX了吗！？\\n诶～那个……稍微再休息一会儿也没关系哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba553bcd4ebeb5f170556f1cd22a29aa44e91321722ebcc599a5158d18338c56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cec95987708077d0bd7eb7fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "【慰劳的手作点心与便条】\\nTP恢复了哦！我在老地方等你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aaeb64b1c67898f350d3ee9682243eafcd18dc579f8438126d96a77764bc577",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e0af569d735973a1601af28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你在发什么呆。\\n别浪费余的 TP。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61f5f0da6b272adac05e39670a50dc1b7c943fd5257db238005fa131e0bfc66f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bb3fa150ca51e80500604f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经满了呢。\\n能让我变得更强大吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb2737e051bee5ce856eb3864b67f344606add81aec466096d2c6bf4f99e9ab9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db8597f4256e060767795be5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP 已经满了。\\n我会一边进行基础训练一边等着你哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe96d4e6eaa9e0d9a020b95a5b4b31902ec9dd7c926b632d73a494ce7fb5aa5c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b37de2ecf1da15b347f70d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经完全恢复了。\\n我会先行开始，请您不必挂心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1415fc7039f6685293b00ae8c401721957d38d4a7624aa68309fc7b06e77c10a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c52dfee1e1bcbdd03862e519",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好了，时间到了。TP全恢复，准备也万全……\\n本日的训练，也请多多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79139bd152866171b2d9ad0c2bf1ddab2c670184e25f6652e3499c848d4a5343",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38fc2769ee5ebff180104fc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经满了。\\n让我们再次以最高速疾驰吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d24f536dd969f4a218675f2916453eff1b9407d0011f5594041a4b706e16005",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:811f2054c598fbd9cb1d265f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吾主，TP已达MAX。\\n准备已就绪。您打算如何安排？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a7b738a264d6c31cddfba793ccde72febbcc9ad695747b360c3a6aabb3c8373",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd29b7573550860387f707b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔，TP好像攒满了。\\n热身运动已经做完，随时可以开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4769398b6755afbc9338c042e0b14d5d24d7f05a75e5915ea50406d3af8df824",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7771fde15422306f38231181",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP 已满！\\n随时可以下达出动命令！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4779eb5a2c36668c78af5bb75ce62723836f6e82b8280b145bff58c226212e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeecb42ed431c9eafa96233d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP恢复了！快走吧！\\n细微的差距往往就是胜负的关键！",
      "source_fingerprint": "624c94e251b2a9d68d99644bd55c30da0b79ed17ab467ebe0874da68af8429c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9836140f74f49a45d57e504b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经回满了。\\n……来，今天也要堂堂正正地开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84be18ac562bcfca804e1a1a72ed8415a38f2c75b45cdfd98bc5f9f0b923cd55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d763c1fcc8c826848723f8b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP 已经恢复了！\\n我的准备可是200英里级的万无一失！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30f609f0addd1b12d35069266feaa667c87717bf95849e4d665b0ad0774244c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c22197576cb5aa5063eb83a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP 已经满了哦！\\n我会等着你的爱哟？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b561427b558efd940a692af4d149fb6d1fa192bafc3e35f3bb8c7859ecaba1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0cf2cca21a918748a8dcf12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP 已恢复。\\n我会一边整理史料，一边等您……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6425263365dca03ebe7b4673da6d81cf60e9fc7032782ffd1f6abcc43bbfa46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc06c9b43a762f0eb43f3831",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经……充盈了。\n为了能让梦想开花结果，今天您也愿意与我同行吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "efbe0fe316d5a0a3bbed5631854040752b09fb50070bbeefeb30812f78ecbecb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cffc5f08e2b2951a1ce6bb2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满了吗。\\n……按捺不住了吧？那颗想要旅行的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43d289f06169f40a8f8a19f69a20a09c20b1d7d34ddbc166bd5564cc4a2b75ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3692a8863b8c95868af5924e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我已蒙受了满满的TP。\n我会祈祷着，等待您的到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9efa6d98009dac1ffa665f50e780141a7cf36e2d7e115213e8299ce480eecd8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d36e11220479a0b700cca1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "【新连载开始】TP攒满啦！\\n神业的全新篇章今天也要开始了哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5555111b47ed8624432732d6afd6776dbecacdd9ab6c471a7b9e6c6559fb3d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c403d9972d6944b66e8e7c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP已经攒满了。\\n是小鸟小姐告诉我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "722ab7fdd563ca1c1e5cb07d37946a7f63b2a36d7f7b0fe56088ef777e023929",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b9cce4ea207f1ff3203a4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP完全恢复，顺便干劲也拉满了。\n要行动的话，现在就是最优解……开始我们的游戏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1f99a0c1ea4584097cc36d60c137a97299dae86c89f0d0074bc167ae124aeac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c106bf8a57d896a16c56c2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像满了……！\\n我会不断地参加赛事，成为日本第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb956a886c181c1ad3069e2c8376ef4a6324a3bf872e8292e9ebd5aab9b51202",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9e228fcf46975859c598946",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像完全恢复了。\\n那个……我也想出战赛事。……可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5296b3ba62db530ab1038d7e241866a50be9df610b7ec6244e5e74613d270a01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d5fed8610b41c9ac378f3f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP已经完全恢复了～♪呼呼呼。\\n无敌的帝皇大人带来的赛事，难道不想看看吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5f4f0aab6eabf298ab8ed3ff3a2a34425031b74ee1b0388aaba3853b87a57a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f4d88ae069a20c3a9d8ca3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像完全恢复了呢！赶快……走起？\\n不管是车子还是赛事，一鼓作气冲刺才最痛快哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab63d39c8e881bd954dfef45fb9ea9a88eb5a1a000e4d91ced083041c64b9ce3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:073f65bb3cffe9d231160ed5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀……在等你的这段时间，RP好像完全恢复了呢。\\n那么接下来……呵呵，我会让你尽情享受的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2b3e987c9e88d65f699d547fe1d33a7bf5229a7838e0cb213137738cdae085f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ded7539bf753286bb44baab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP已经满了……。\\n我也希望你能让我参加赛事……我想为你带去胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d3c273598730e5c5b2356c5e843072df6ad6b6f74bf0b549449a906117bd7bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310dca5b84ca1ebebf19a3dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有一条来自黄金船大人的讯息。\\n『标题：RP已经完全恢复了』……噢，欧啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbb886be1138fb963e0f0a4b3c3291acbdcdffb50b1d9486e7896b94c48ad2da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1824c884b30630cbcfe63fbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂，训练员！听说RP已经完全恢复了哦！\\n所以……挑选让人热血沸腾的赛事就拜托你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b28878f61ee79da0cbd53c9c8a28898b992690a9445243f0d157b131e66b2b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c71653499d860839c0f1f23b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐，训练员！听说RP已经完全恢复了！\\n下次的赛事……拿第一的可是我哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bf5a184a198f0a658f8f201bf7e0748bdf8d9bc06f3a06bb3fb5916125d135",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:333c370b08ea1427fa813d0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Wow，RP满了！训练员，Hurry up！\\n也让Me参加赛事吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bae8f332f6035482be40ccbc404d26d4c2906825af044cdac44d39ae1a6477c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7db3f52bcec15d0833af462f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP已经完全恢复了……我已经为赛事\\n做好了准备。随时等您的吩咐哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e5cdc52d5c8f43a9a24b1bc07cbb7daf521318fdf5a3c69b35b45f14b09f068",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88f977443332b231db0a282b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦哦，RP不是满了吗！\\n不错嘛，让人跃跃欲试呢！来吧，单挑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b88eac7579fe564b20e511aa7d8302359f5805de59968ab606947df8e69637b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced561b8b311893df2f4f723",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP已经完全恢复了……所以，请交给我吧。\\n作为目白家的赛马娘，我会为您夺取胜利的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d68778a32d10038a931b81c41586f461bfe2df294cd61c98973582e4001360d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a925b80092bf9d45ff099bf7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP！MAX！Muy bien！！！！\\n神鹰在赛事中也会华丽地飞舞哦ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2543a81c34487948ae465e74fcd1a6e5d113a40c29bd91233fa4f30209552904",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64c3a1316c24af6fa332e81a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP已经全部恢复了。不过不用着急。\\n从容地夺取胜利，才是霸王应有的姿态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51f566027d1455f8c3bbeb9e7521e85f0cbea44545cb7747706f9b5b790a5cab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11c0afe4115d0d43dc3c1754",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像完全恢复了。\\n快点安排我参加赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04c50977486c11545d1cf0afdf23563a37a9fbcab5c8ef57a196ac9692b96de0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e7f14ca1ec0c55c0084286",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP已经完全恢复了。既然心中抱有应做之事，\\n我就必须站在顶点……所以让我们一起不断挑战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec761bff5a2e73bf9eba0c0341872400f78fd501ec393ee38af331bfeaed07c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddf10e40b26ff83f3224aa7b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像完全恢复了。应该出战\\n哪场赛事……你想好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "37fbb1f2c8b13ebdde3598b4dfce36256e46f3c7bef2b649358f005ab4b4b581",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1354f9d4840671354797b83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像满了！\\n嗯哼哼，朝着最佳位置Let's go！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9364342c3490a73de3abde5feec132536e4551172b7b3fbeaf27332be653acbb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f73ed3a4fa2a6f4b3062bca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP，装得满满的哦ー。\\n那么，这次要用什么作战呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "05fc4d26e0ea23ee80b256d83101038e2397ffb17eb9e60440702557dccf7aa2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee3a0397e7bd930766d10ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满啦！攒着不用太亏了！\\n把咱的干劲也大把大把地用掉吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c531f3f1c5f71fe1710e1028aa289dc49c85e348f4c30c86c3a6631bb691c0bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4612ea1f00f2907e33cf66a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP完全恢复了哦～♪\\n……那么，能护送我去赛场吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f23efb869ac5cc412c15da2a2036a646c7bc847ae7ed277aaadf1ca56e207e23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d89dee4bd48dd0cfd660ceca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像完全恢复了。那么下一场赛事\\n该采取什么策略呢……我等着你的意见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36021ac98da818d36a82053daf77f3e12e1aa5ac408fdbd3c0ac9c07458e8d99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:496dde4ea09372d9d54aae43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP满了ー！\\n呐呐， Maya也想参加赛事～！欸嘿嘿～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c178901393e1a39092ba39b0871420798636f064ab569eb7f923179c0bf309",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:987da78b877a0f43b8ebea8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP完全恢复了……。\\n还有……建议你不要看窗外……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2dc15d7a89d9ad7d4ab97fd1b50e11451577a13fa9a4bdc56484b124ae7e944",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
